     ],
     "rationale": "Bringing forward Clearview Glazing's delivery of the unitised curtain wall panels (currently due 2027-03-03) to shortly after steel erection finishes lets the facade-follows-frame resequencing actually be realised on site, rather than the glazing crew standing down waiting for panels. This pairs a supplier commitment with the sequencing change to capture the full benefit on the critical path.",
     "risks": "Unitised curtain walling is a bespoke, long-lead package; Clearview may not be able to re-prioritise their fabrication slot without a premium, and panels delivered early need secure, weatherproof storage and extra craneage. If the supplier can't confirm, no time is actually recovered.",
